  "title": "Old-Fashioned Rhubarb Cake",
  "description": "This recipe makes a sweet and moist rhubarb cake with a buttery cinnamon topping; delicious served warm with ice cream for a springtime dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Barb Oke"
  ],
