  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "1 egg",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup buttermilk",
    "2 cups rhubarb, chopped",
    "1 tablespoon all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup packed brown sugar",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly butter a 9x13-inch baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yBnc3zB6zCLtFAFZrhFobEISU80=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7468-rhubarb-cake-i-DDMFS-018-step-01-73b3b0385a014a528fff779d0003ca89.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7468/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and sugar together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy in color. Beat in egg and vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4Ejex4_JSNxpIqNqjlVdPM4Jlts=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7468-rhubarb-cake-i-DDMFS-020-step-02-e2f352267f0e4fb6b9e61608712f81a1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7468/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift 2 cups flour, baking soda, and salt together in a separate bowl; add alternately with buttermilk to butter mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SE84bZfzna40GZf8u6EjfEQjPNI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7468-rhubarb-cake-i-DDMFS-022-step-03-ed13129dcfa34a1cade38bc5e48ab5ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7468/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss rhubarb with 1 tablespoon flour, and stir into batter. Spoon batter into prepared baking pan and smooth the surface.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uT9RJvcPBi9u_OcatEMeEsku748=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7468-rhubarb-cake-i-DDMFS-024-step-04-d0b7768024c04f01bfeb5ea558e0ffe0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7468/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix brown sugar, 1/4 cup butter, and cinnamon together; sprinkle evenly over batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-8hb4LfgbWpnOOn2gkyfzxS856c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7468-rhubarb-cake-i-DDMFS-025-step-05-e28ddc54e39c4a13ab21ab7061518ed6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7468/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the cake comes out clean and the top is golden, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Cnty8E1hGafOpjgwcks08A-8uJA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7468-rhubarb-cake-i-DDMFS-061-step-06-969d3243e9654c10ae0626d0c4af6bcc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7468/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rDCFzsZ8lv2r4MGDP0mmzxZQhD0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7468-rhubarb-cake-i-DDMFS-077-4x3-b5d89921cfd242ca92465ae796ecfd1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7468/step_07.webp"
    }
